Hi Kerin,

> I think the approach should be turn the vcf into a genclone object, isolate the clonal populations only into its own genclone object from the rest of the database, and do mlgfilter and then cutoff predictor on the clonal populations to identify the clonal threshold?

Instead of a genclone, you might want to use a snpclone object (if you do want a genclone, be sure you use return.alleles = TRUE when you convert from VCF).

Beyond that, I'm afraid there's not much I can offer in the way of advice other than to read https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/j.1365-294X.2007.03535.x for some information about how to handle clonal organisms. I have been out of this field for several years and I guarantee there is more up-to-date literature on this.

